{"schema_version": 1, "run_id": "sw-msi-inventory.k7Qd2x", "source": "governance-agent", "recorded_by": null, "commit_range": "a98627f7c..6a34b7173", "reporter": "security-guardian", "reviewed_at_sha": "6a34b7173", "recorded_at": "2026-10-18T18:30:00Z", "pass_ordinal": 1, "finding_id": "mp-property-read-conflated", "severity_native": "MEDIUM", "severity_mapped": "BLOCKING", "trigger": "a property read returns a code other than success, 1605 or 1608 (non-readable identity, corrupt registration)", "impact": ["I3"], "exposure": ["E4", "E5"], "epistemic_status": "likely", "policy_floor": null, "provenance": "introduced", "file": "agents/plugins/msi_packages/src/msi_packages_plugin.cpp", "line": 177, "summary": "A failed MsiGetProductInfoExW property read became an empty field under a clean status, so a host whose reads fail (corrupt registration, refused access) would report an empty or short roster and the server would delete the stored msi rows. Raised independently by security-guardian, unhappy-path, cross-platform and architect.", "classification": "truth-contradiction", "independent_reporters": 4, "disposition": "open"}
{"schema_version": 1, "run_id": "sw-msi-inventory.k7Qd2x", "finding_id": "mp-property-read-conflated", "recorded_by": "workflow-orchestrator (Doomgoose session)", "recorded_at": "2026-10-18T18:45:00Z", "pass_ordinal": 3, "reviewed_at_sha": "f0b07893a", "disposition": "fixed", "classification_rationale": "Fixed in 959a4fd2a and f0b07893a: only ERROR_UNKNOWN_PRODUCT/ERROR_UNKNOWN_PROPERTY read as an empty value, any other code makes the roster constrained with windows:msi_prop:<rc> (whole cycle skipped). The benign codes were measured on a Windows 11 host (provenance.txt) and pinned by pure-seam tests."}
{"schema_version": 1, "run_id": "sw-msi-inventory.k7Qd2x", "source": "governance-agent", "recorded_by": null, "commit_range": "a98627f7c..6a34b7173", "reporter": "cpp-safety", "reviewed_at_sha": "6a34b7173", "recorded_at": "2026-10-18T18:30:00Z", "pass_ordinal": 1, "finding_id": "mp-embedded-nul", "severity_native": "BLOCKING", "severity_mapped": "BLOCKING", "trigger": "a property value whose reported length spans a NUL", "impact": ["I3"], "exposure": ["E5"], "epistemic_status": "likely", "policy_floor": null, "provenance": "introduced", "file": "agents/plugins/msi_packages/src/msi_packages_inventory.hpp", "line": 85, "summary": "An interior NUL in a property value survived into the row; write_output goes through a C string and truncates, so the row had fewer than five tokens and the adapter dropped the product silently under a supported status. Whether the OS can return such a value was not established.", "classification": "truth-contradiction", "independent_reporters": 5, "disposition": "open"}
{"schema_version": 1, "run_id": "sw-msi-inventory.k7Qd2x", "finding_id": "mp-embedded-nul", "recorded_by": "workflow-orchestrator (Doomgoose session)", "recorded_at": "2026-10-18T18:45:00Z", "pass_ordinal": 3, "reviewed_at_sha": "f0b07893a", "disposition": "fixed", "classification_rationale": "Fixed in 959a4fd2a: the value is read NUL-terminated (from_wide default length) and strip_row_breakers deletes NUL; a test pins the strip."}
